# ---- Backend generated data (H2 files only; books pipeline output IS versioned) ----
# backend/data/books/valid/ and invalid/ are intentionally tracked: the sample books are
# committed already sorted into their correct outcome, so a fresh clone ships with a
# real, reviewable catalog without requiring anyone to re-run the ingestion pipeline.
backend/data/db/

